BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (    stream would triple in abundance as it flowed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (  The first Water-Keeper, moved by compassion, sent one-third of their water downstream. The spi) Tj ET
