BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (  Over seasons, a rhythm emerged. When Water-Keepers sent generously, the downstream village pro) Tj ET
