BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (    magic only worked through trust.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (  The wisest Water-Keepers learned that sending freely created prosperity for all. Even when ret) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (    urns varied like the phases of the moon, the act of giving itself invited reciprocity. The r) Tj ET
