BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  Two villages arose along the spring's banks-Upstream and Downstream. The Spring Guardian gave ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    Upstream five vessels of water each season, saying: "What you pour in multiplies threefold f) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    or Downstream. They may then return what they choose to you.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  At first, Upstream hoarded all five vessels, fearing loss. Downstream received nothing and cou) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (    ld return nothing. Both suffered through drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (  Then a wise elder suggested: "Trust in the spring's magic." Upstream poured three vessels into) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (     the spring. These became nine for Downstream, who prospered greatly and gratefully returned) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (     five vessels. Upstream now had seven total-more than their original five!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 648.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 638.0 Td (  Seeing this miracle, both villages embraced the sacred cycle. The more Upstream trusted, the m) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 628.0 Td (    ore the spring multiplied, and the more Downstream could return. Abundance flowed endlessly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (  The Guardian's final teaching echoed through generations: "The spring's magic works only throu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (    gh trust. Send generously, for what multiplies can return greater than what you held. Receiv) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (    e gratefully, and honor trust with fair return. Thus both villages flourish beyond what eith) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (    er could achieve alone.") Tj ET
