BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 618.0 Td (      # The Parable of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 608.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 598.0 Td (      In ancient times, the god of abundance discovered a Sacred Spring with miraculous powers. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 588.0 Td (        Any offering of water poured into it would triple before flowing downstream to others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (      Two villages arose along the spring's banks-Upstream and Downstream. The Spring Guardian g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        ave Upstream five vessels of water each season, saying: "What you pour in multiplies thr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (        eefold for Downstream. They may then return what they choose to you.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 528.0 Td (      At first, Upstream hoarded all five vessels, fearing loss. Downstream received nothing and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 518.0 Td (         could return nothing. Both suffered through drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 508.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 498.0 Td (      Then a wise elder suggested: "Trust in the spring's magic." Upstream poured three vessels ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (        into the spring. These became nine for Downstream, who prospered greatly and gratefully ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (        returned five vessels. Upstream now had seven total-more than their original five!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      Seeing this miracle, both villages embraced the sacred cycle. The more Upstream trusted, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (        he more the spring multiplied, and the more Downstream could return. Abundance flowed en) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (        dlessly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      The Guardian's final teaching echoed through generations: "The spring's magic works only t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (        hrough trust. Send generously, for what multiplies can return greater than what you held) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (        . Receive gratefully, and honor trust with fair return. Thus both villages flourish beyo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (        nd what either could achieve alone.") Tj ET
BT /F2 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    reasoning:) Tj ET
