BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 488.0 Td (    # The Parable of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 478.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 468.0 Td (    In ancient times, the god of abundance discovered a Sacred Spring with miraculous powers. An) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 458.0 Td (      y offering of water poured into it would triple before flowing downstream to others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 448.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 438.0 Td (    Two villages arose along the spring's banks-Upstream and Downstream. The Spring Guardian gav) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 428.0 Td (      e Upstream five vessels of water each season, saying: "What you pour in multiplies threefo) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 418.0 Td (      ld for Downstream. They may then return what they choose to you.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 408.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 398.0 Td (    At first, Upstream hoarded all five vessels, fearing loss. Downstream received nothing and c) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 388.0 Td (      ould return nothing. Both suffered through drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 378.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 368.0 Td (    Then a wise elder suggested: "Trust in the spring's magic." Upstream poured three vessels in) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 358.0 Td (      to the spring. These became nine for Downstream, who prospered greatly and gratefully retu) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 348.0 Td (      rned five vessels. Upstream now had seven total-more than their original five!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 338.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 328.0 Td (    Seeing this miracle, both villages embraced the sacred cycle. The more Upstream trusted, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 318.0 Td (       more the spring multiplied, and the more Downstream could return. Abundance flowed endles) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 308.0 Td (      sly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 298.0 Td (    ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 288.0 Td (    The Guardian's final teaching echoed through generations: "The spring's magic works only thr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 278.0 Td (      ough trust. Send generously, for what multiplies can return greater than what you held. Re) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 268.0 Td (      ceive gratefully, and honor trust with fair return. Thus both villages flourish beyond wha) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 258.0 Td (      t either could achieve alone.") Tj ET
