BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 578.0 Td (      In the time before time, two villages stood on opposite banks of the River Eternal. The Up) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 568.0 Td (        stream Village received fresh water each day, while the Downstream Village struggled wit) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 558.0 Td (        h drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 548.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 538.0 Td (      The Water-Keeper of the Upstream Village faced a choice: hoard the precious water or relea) Tj ET
