BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 248.0 Td (      # The Parable of the Sacred Spring) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 238.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 228.0 Td (      In ancient times, the god of abundance discovered a Sacred Spring with miraculous powers. ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        Any offering of water poured into it would triple before flowing downstream to others.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 198.0 Td (      Two villages arose along the spring's banks-Upstream and Downstream. The Spring Guardian g) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 188.0 Td (        ave Upstream five vessels of water each season, saying: "What you pour in multiplies thr) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 178.0 Td (        eefold for Downstream. They may then return what they choose to you.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 168.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 158.0 Td (      At first, Upstream hoarded all five vessels, fearing loss. Downstream received nothing and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 148.0 Td (         could return nothing. Both suffered through drought.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 138.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 128.0 Td (      Then a wise elder suggested: "Trust in the spring's magic." Upstream poured three vessels ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 118.0 Td (        into the spring. These became nine for Downstream, who prospered greatly and gratefully ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 108.0 Td (        returned five vessels. Upstream now had seven total-more than their original five!) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 98.0 Td (      ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 88.0 Td (      Seeing this miracle, both villages embraced the sacred cycle. The more Upstream trusted, t) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 78.0 Td (        he more the spring multiplied, and the more Downstream could return. Abundance flowed en) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 68.0 Td (        dlessly.) Tj ET
